    ("How much does it cost to work with ECOS Medicare Solutions?", "Nothing. Independent Medicare agents are paid by the insurance carriers when you enroll, so comparing plans, answering questions and reviewing your coverage each year is free to you. Your premium is the same whether you enroll through us, another agent or the carrier directly."),
    ("My Medicare Advantage plan left my Ohio county. What now?", "You get a Special Enrollment Period to choose a new plan and, because you lost coverage through no fault of your own, generally a guaranteed-issue right to buy a Medigap policy without health questions, usually within 63 days of the coverage ending. For 2026 Medical Mutual did not renew some plans in 44 counties and Aetna ended its Smart Fit plan, so a lot of Ohioans are in this position. Ohio has no birthday rule to fall back on later, so use the window. Call before the deadline on your notice."),
