    ("Can Ohio help pay my Part B premium?", "Possibly. Ohio&rsquo;s Medicare Savings Programs (QMB, SLMB, QI), run through Ohio Medicaid, pay the Part B premium for people with limited income and resources, and QMB also covers Medicare&rsquo;s deductibles and copays. They are not subject to estate recovery and bring Part D Extra Help automatically. Apply at benefits.ohio.gov or 800-324-8680; OSHIIP (800-686-1578) helps with the form for free."),
